1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,289
The organs to know.

2
00:00:01,289 --> 00:00:09,739
Underground stems: the rhizome of ginger, the tuber of potato, the bulb of onion, the corm of Colocasia.

3
00:00:09,739 --> 00:00:16,875
Creeping stems: the runner of dubo grass, the sucker of mint, the offset of water hyacinth.

4
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:18,958
Leaves, in Bryophyllum.

5
00:00:18,958 --> 00:00:21,966
And roots, in sweet potato and Dahlia.

